					"left": 24,
					"top": 138,
					"width": 952,
					"height": 34,
					"text": "Every button asks the component to fail in one specific way. Rows keep the whole envelope: failureKind, code, message — plus the JSON the UI received. 4D runtime errors (for example the picture read that fails on the corrupt fixture) are logged to webp-demo-work/runtime-errors.log.",
